      "body": "<h2>The arrival</h2><p>The company wakes in an unfamiliar landscape. Their different recollections of the moments before arrival do not resolve its cause.</p><h2>A beginning, not an explanation</h2><p>No narrator establishes a summoner or identifies this place as a familiar plane. Irenhour’s theories remain theories.</p>",
