      "body": "<h2>A refuge offered</h2><p>Cala reveals the Oasis between two dunes and says its resources will meet the company’s needs.</p><h2>The open question</h2><p>She explicitly denies causing their arrival. Her account points toward other forces without resolving their identity.</p>",
