      "title": "Ambush in the Free Quarter",
      "summary": "An attack on the company ends with Nazif guards intervening and Ibin Ali arranging restitution.",
      "dek": "An attack on the company ends with Nazif guards intervening and Ibin Ali arranging restitution.",
